        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>找工作就要像海王一样</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    padding: 20px 0;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 3px solid #c8365f;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 18px 16px 24px 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title-bar {\n    background: #c8365f;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border-radius: 30px;\n    padding: 10px 0;\n    margin: 4px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .intro {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    color: #444;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .section-header {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg,#f6b17a,#f2955a);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 0;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .flow {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .left-box {\n    flex: 0 0 90px;\n    background: #f6c9d3;\n    color: #b23a55;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 6px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .right-box {\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #333;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .right-box .label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .warn {\n    background: #fdece0;\n    border: 1px solid #f2b98a;\n  }\n  .warn .label { color: #e07b39; }\n  .ref {\n    background: #eaf5e9;\n    border: 1px solid #a8d5a3;\n  }\n  .ref .label { color: #4a9c4a; }\n  .icon-x {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    width: 13px;\n    height: 13px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #e05a3a;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .icon-check {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    width: 13px;\n    height: 13px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #4a9c4a;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .emoji {\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">找工作就要像海王一样</div>\n\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n    <span class=\"emoji\">🧜</span> 找工作真的不要太老实容易吃亏 说话要像海王一样圆滑多变 什么好听说什么就对了！\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 1 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">万能打招呼话术</div>\n    <div class=\"flow\">\n      <div class=\"left-box\">适用于各大<br>招聘软件</div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <div class=\"right-box warn\">\n          <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"icon-x\">✕</span>要注意的点</div>\n          铁汁莫招聘软件自带的打招呼话术真的很拉胯，全部都是千篇一律的，一点不能突出你的特色，打招呼的时候一定让HR知道你跟应位比合度是非常高的。\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-box ref\">\n          <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"icon-check\">✓</span>参考话术</div>\n          XX经理您好！<br>\n          我有X年XX工作/实习经验，负责过XX项目、XX项目，给公司带去了XX价值，感觉和贵公司岗位要求高匹配的，希望能进一步沟通一下，详情请看我的简历，谢谢您！\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 2 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">已读不回话术</div>\n    <div class=\"flow\">\n      <div class=\"left-box\">已读不回<br>这样问</div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <div class=\"right-box warn\">\n          <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"icon-x\">✕</span>要注意的点</div>\n          已读不回真的很不礼貌，但是想想你每天收到几百份简历，一个一个回复的没那么多时间，所以你要主动，有时候不是你不合适，是太多简历看不过来，所以可以主动问问。\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-box ref\">\n          <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"icon-check\">✓</span>参考话术</div>\n          您好！<br>\n          看您已经读过我的消息，如有疑问，我这边随时给您解答，如果不合适，烦请告知下原因，我好及时调整，如果觉得还不错，是否可以约时间面试一下呢？\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 3 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">收到offer回复话术</div>\n    <div class=\"flow\">\n      <div class=\"left-box\">确认offer<br>这样说</div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <div class=\"right-box warn\">\n          <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"icon-x\">✕</span>要注意的点</div>\n          确定offer后回复一下是基本的礼貌，也是给公司一个明确的答复，通知他们不要再找人面试了，这个回复很有必要哦。\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-box ref\">\n          <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"icon-check\">✓</span>参考话术</div>\n          您发送的邮件offer我已收到，感谢贵公司对我的认可，我周一早上会随同入职材料按时报道，如有其它要求，请随时与我联系，祝您生活愉快！\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
